2026-11-06T03:19:00.6871108Z [1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer[0m
2026-11-06T03:19:00.6968017Z [32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
2026-11-06T03:19:00.6977568Z [0m
2026-11-06T03:19:00.6978054Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-11-06T03:19:00.6978671Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-11-06T03:19:00.6978970Z 
2026-11-06T03:19:00.6979233Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
2026-11-06T03:19:00.6979863Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
2026-11-06T03:19:00.6980236Z 
2026-11-06T03:19:00.6980518Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
2026-11-06T03:19:00.6981081Z    if you are ready to continue.
2026-11-06T03:19:00.6981384Z 
2026-11-06T03:19:00.6982281Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [30001..30008])[0m and groups [34m(gid 30000)[0m
2026-11-06T03:19:00.6983034Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-11-06T03:19:00.6983568Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-11-06T03:19:00.6983895Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-11-06T03:19:00.6984187Z 
2026-11-06T03:19:00.6984340Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-11-06T03:19:00.6984552Z 
2026-11-06T03:19:00.6984732Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-11-06T03:19:00.6985080Z    can use Nix.
2026-11-06T03:19:00.6985218Z 
2026-11-06T03:19:00.6985320Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-11-06T03:19:00.6985469Z 
2026-11-06T03:19:00.6985726Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-11-06T03:19:00.6986359Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-11-06T03:19:00.6989712Z 
2026-11-06T03:19:00.6990118Z I will:
2026-11-06T03:19:00.6990306Z 
2026-11-06T03:19:00.6990600Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-11-06T03:19:00.6991185Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-11-06T03:19:00.6991747Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-06T03:19:00.6992370Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-06T03:19:00.6992816Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-06T03:19:00.6993216Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-06T03:19:00.6993662Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-06T03:19:00.6994020Z    /root
2026-11-06T03:19:00.7004210Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-06T03:19:00.7004827Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-06T03:19:00.7015477Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-11-06T03:19:00.7016349Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-11-06T03:19:00.7016598Z 
2026-11-06T03:19:00.7017431Z [32m[4;32mReady to continue?
2026-11-06T03:19:00.7017768Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
